#   tests_time_ranges - Ladybird's Tests/LibMedia/TestTimeRanges.cpp
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Tests/LibMedia/TestTimeRanges.cpp (lines 1-327), case for case: adding,
#       removing, the highest end time, coalescing, intersecting and finding the range at or
#       after a point. `TimeRanges { { a, b }, ... }` is written as pairs of milliseconds.
